-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Reference implementations
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

tools/reference/ contains the exploratory scripts (JavaScript and Python) that
established the tokenizer packing format, the g-value scheme, and the golden
vectors. They are committed as PROVENANCE for the ports in packages/ and web/.
They are not part of the build and are not shipped.
